Package: ble2mqtt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bluez
Description: Forward BLE sensor broadcasts to an MQTT server
 ble2mqtt listens for Bluetooth Low Energy broadcasts from Xiaomi Mijia
 sensors running the ATC firmware. It publishes each reading to an MQTT
 server as JSON, ready for Home Assistant.
 .
 Write a configuration to /etc/ble2mqtt/ble2mqtt.conf, then start the
 service. An example is in /usr/share/doc/ble2mqtt/examples.
